<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>The Radha Legacy | Official Page</title>
    <%- include('./partials/head', { title:'The Radha Legacy | Official Page' }) %>
    
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,900;1,700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --deep-emerald: #022c22;
            --classic-green: #064e3b;
            --gold-leaf: #c5a059;
            --silk: #fdfcf8;
            --pure-white: #ffffff;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--silk); color: var(--deep-emerald); line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; }
        h1, h2, h3, h4, .serif { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

        .container { padding: 0 25px; max-width: 1200px; margin: auto; }
        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.17, 0.67, 0.83, 0.67); }
        .reveal.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        /* ===============================
           TYPOGRAPHY
        =============================== */
        .section-title { font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .journey-title { font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1; }
        .text-lead { font-size: 0.80rem; color: #444; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .tagline { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--gold-leaf); letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px;}

        /* ===============================
           HERO
        =============================== */
        .hero {
            height: 80vh; 
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(2, 44, 34, 0.4), rgba(2, 44, 34, 0.9)), url('/images/IMG_8975.jpg') center/cover; 
            display: flex; align-items: center; color: var(--pure-white); position: relative;
        }
        .hero-inner { max-width: 900px; padding-left: 5%; margin-left: 20px;}
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 0.95; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 900; }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold-leaf); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 1px; max-width: 600px; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 30px;}

        /* ===============================
           FLOATING STAT CHIPS
        =============================== */
        .stat-chips-wrapper { position: relative; margin-top: -50px; z-index: 10; }
        .stat-chips {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); background: var(--pure-white);
            border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); padding: 30px 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
        }
        .chip { text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #eee; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
        .chip:last-child { border-right: none; }
        .chip-icon { color: var(--gold-leaf); margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .chip-number-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--deep-emerald); margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .chip-number-wrap h4 { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1; }
        .chip-suffix { color: var(--gold-leaf); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 2px; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }
        .chip-label { font-size: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #666; font-weight: 600; }

        /* ===============================
           SECTION PADDINGS 
        =============================== */
        .foundation { padding: 80px 0; background: var(--pure-white); margin-top: -50px; margin-bottom: -50px;}
        .journey { padding-top: 40px; background: var(--deep-emerald); color: var(--silk); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .why-us { padding: 90px 0; background: var(--pure-white); }
        .guardian-section { padding: 90px 0; background: var(--silk); border-top: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15); }
        .final-cta { padding: 90px 0; text-align: center; background: var(--deep-emerald); color: white; }

        /* ===============================
           FOUNDATION
        =============================== */
        .foundation-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 50px; align-items: center; }
        .f-image-stack { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 2px; }
        .f-image-stack img { width: 100%; height: 450px; object-fit: cover; transform: scale(1.1); transition: transform 1.5s ease; }
        .f-image-stack.active img { transform: scale(1); }
        .f-overlay-box { 
            position: absolute; bottom: -20px; right: 20px; background: rgba(2, 44, 34, 0.85); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); color: var(--gold-leaf); 
            padding: 30px; border-left: 4px solid var(--gold-leaf); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); z-index: 2;
        }
        .f-overlay-box h4 { font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 5px; }

        /* ===============================
           JOURNEY
        =============================== */
        .journey::after {
            content: "LEGACY"; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); 
            font-size: 18vw; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 900; color: transparent; 
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08); z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
        }
        .journey-wrapper { display: flex; gap: 60px; align-items: flex-start; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .journey-sticky { position: sticky; top: 120px; flex: 1; }
        .journey-scroll { flex: 1.2; padding-top: 10px; }
        .t-point { margin-bottom: 60px; position: relative; padding-left: 35px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3); }
        .t-point::before { 
            content: ""; position: absolute; left: -6px; top: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; 
            background: var(--gold-leaf); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5);
        }
        .t-point h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--gold-leaf); }

        /* ===============================
           MISSION (UPDATED PORTRAIT GRID)
        =============================== */
        .mission { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--silk); border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
        .mission-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
        
        .mission-image-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; text-align: right; }
        .mission-image-wrap img { 
            width: 90%; max-width: 450px; height: 450px; object-fit: cover; 
            border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: -15px 15px 0 rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15); 
        }
        
        /* This centers the text vertically and horizontally inside the column */
        .mission-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
        .mission-content svg {text-align: center; color: var(--gold-leaf); }
        .mission-content p { 
            font-size: 1.4rem; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; 
            color: var(--classic-green); margin-bottom: 30px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 500px;
        }

        /* ===============================
           WHY CHOOSE: BENTO GRID
        =============================== */
        .bento-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .bento-card { padding: 40px 30px; border-radius: 12px; transition: 0.4s; border: 1px solid #f1f1f1; position: relative; }
        .bento-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--gold-leaf); box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .bento-large { grid-column: span 2; background: var(--deep-emerald); color: var(--pure-white); border: none; }
        .bento-large h3 { color: var(--gold-leaf); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;}
        .bento-small { background: var(--silk); color: var(--deep-emerald); }
        .bento-small h3 { color: var(--classic-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;}

        /* ===============================
           GUARDIAN PROMISE 
        =============================== */
        .guardian-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 50px; align-items: center; }
        .guardian-img-wrap { position: relative; }
        .guardian-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 450px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px; }
        .guardian-badge {
            position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: -20px; background: var(--deep-emerald); color: var(--pure-white); 
            padding: 20px 25px; box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-leaf);
        }
        .testimonial-box {
            padding: 25px; background: var(--pure-white); border-left: 3px solid var(--classic-green); 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* ===============================
           BUTTONS
        =============================== */
        /* ===============================
           BUTTONS (SOLID & OUTLINE)
        =============================== */
        .cta-btn, .cta-outline {
            display: inline-flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            letter-spacing: 2px; 
            font-size: 0.8rem; 
            line-height: 1; 
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        /* THE FIX: Push the SVG down to perfectly align with uppercase text */
        .cta-btn svg, .cta-outline svg {
            display: block;
            flex-shrink: 0; /* Prevents the icon from squishing */
            transform: translateY(2px); /* Pushes the arrow DOWN */
        }

        .cta-btn {
            padding: 18px 45px; 
            background: var(--gold-leaf); 
            color: var(--deep-emerald); 
        }
        .cta-btn:hover { 
            background: var(--deep-emerald); 
            color: var(--gold-leaf); 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); 
        }
        
        .cta-outline {
            padding: 16px 40px; 
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-leaf); 
            color: var(--deep-emerald); 
        }
        .cta-outline:hover { background: var(--gold-leaf); color: var(--deep-emerald); }
        .cta-outline.light { color: var(--pure-white); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
        .cta-outline.light:hover { background: var(--pure-white); color: var(--deep-emerald); border-color: var(--pure-white); }
        .cta-outline.green { color: var(--classic-green); border-color: var(--classic-green); }
        .cta-outline.green:hover { background: var(--classic-green); color: var(--pure-white); }

        .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 25px; }

        /* ===============================
           MOBILE OPTIMIZATION
        =============================== */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .chip-icon{width: 18px; height: 18px;}
            .foundation, .journey, .why-us, .guardian-section, .final-cta { padding: 60px 0; }
            .mission { padding: 60px 0; }
            .section-title { font-size: 2.1rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
            .journey-title { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .hero-inner { padding-left: 0; }
            
            .stat-chips-wrapper { margin-top: -30px; }
            .stat-chips { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; padding: 5px; }
            .chip:nth-child(even) { border-right: none; }
            .chip:nth-child(1), .chip:nth-child(2) { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px; }
            
            .foundation-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
            .f-image-stack img { height: 300px; } 
            .f-overlay-box { position: relative; bottom: auto; right: auto; margin-top: -20px; width: 90%; padding: 20px; }

            /* Mission Mobile Fix */
            .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
            .mission-image-wrap { text-align: center; }
            .mission-image-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 350px; box-shadow: -10px 10px 0 rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15); }
            .mission-content p { font-size: 1.25rem; padding: 0 10px; }
            
            .journey-wrapper { flex-direction: column; gap: 30px; }
            .journey-sticky { position: static; }
            .journey::after { font-size: 25vw; top: 5%; } 
            
            .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; margin-top: 30px; }
            .bento-large { grid-column: span 1; padding: 30px 20px; }
            .bento-small { padding: 30px 20px; }

            .guardian-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
            .guardian-img-wrap img { height: 300px; }
            .guardian-badge { left: 10px; bottom: -15px; right: 10px; padding: 15px; }
            
            .btn-group { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; }
            .cta-btn, .cta-outline { width: 100%; max-width: 300px; justify-content: center; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 0.75rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/header') %>
    <%- include('./partials/ticker') %>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-inner reveal">
            <span class="tagline">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
                Since 2008
            </span>
            <h1>Trust in Every <span>Mile.</span></h1>
            <p>India’s most prestigious travel partner for families and sacred pilgrimages.</p>
            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn">
                    Begin Your Voyage
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="stat-chips-wrapper reveal" id="stats-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="stat-chips">
                <div class="chip">
                    <svg class="chip-icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
                    <div class="chip-number-wrap"><h4 class="counter" data-target="18">0</h4><span class="chip-suffix">+</span></div>
                    <p class="chip-label">Years Legacy</p>
                </div>
                <div class="chip">
                    <svg class="chip-icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
                    <div class="chip-number-wrap"><h4 class="counter" data-target="10">0</h4><span class="chip-suffix">k+</span></div>
                    <p class="chip-label">Happy Souls</p>
                </div>
                <div class="chip">
                    <svg class="chip-icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                    <div class="chip-number-wrap"><h4 class="counter" data-target="500">0</h4><span class="chip-suffix">+</span></div>
                    <p class="chip-label">Sacred Circuits</p>
                </div>
                <div class="chip">
                    <svg class="chip-icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
                    <div class="chip-number-wrap"><h4 class="counter" data-target="50">0</h4><span class="chip-suffix">+</span></div>
                    <p class="chip-label">Elite Fleet</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="foundation">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="foundation-grid">
                <div class="f-image-stack reveal">
                    <img src="/images/about-story.JPG" alt="Legacy">
                    <div class="f-overlay-box">
                        <h4>18+</h4>
                        <p style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 0.7rem;">Years of Integrity</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="f-text reveal">
                    <h2 class="section-title">A Foundation of Human Connection.</h2>
                    <p class="text-lead">Radha Travels wasn't built on a fleet of cars, but on a fleet of values. We started with a single driver who believed that a passenger is not a customer, but a guest of the family.</p>
                    <p class="text-lead">Today, that single car has grown into a premium network, yet our core remains unshakable: absolute safety, profound respect, and the relentless pursuit of your peace of mind.</p>
                    <a href="/gallery" class="cta-outline">
                        Read Our Full Story
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="journey">
        <div class="container journey-wrapper">
            <div class="journey-sticky reveal">
                <span class="tagline light">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
                    Our Evolution
                </span>
                <h2 class="journey-title">A Legacy<br>of Trust.</h2>
                <p class="text-lead" style="margin-top: 15px; color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.8);">Watch how we grew from a single family car to India's most trusted premium travel concierge.</p>
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <a href="/fleet" class="cta-outline light">
                        Explore Our Fleet
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="journey-scroll">
                <div class="t-point reveal">
                    <h3>2008: The First Light</h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.8);">Founded with one vehicle and a promise to provide honest, reliable transport for local families in Andhra Pradesh.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="t-point reveal">
                    <h3>2016: Sacred Expansion</h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.8);">Specialized into the 'Temple Corridor'. We became the first choice for elders visiting Tirumala, known for our patient and respectful chauffeurs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="t-point reveal">
                    <h3>2026: The New Standard</h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.8);">Integrating elite fleet management technology to ensure the safest road travel experience, merging traditional care with modern transparency.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mission">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="mission-grid">
                <div class="mission-image-wrap reveal">
                    <img src="/images/story-aboutus.jpg" onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516935292305-649f4810795c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800'" alt="Silent Guardian on the Road">
                </div>
                
                <div class="mission-content reveal">
                    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1">
                        <path d="M3 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.756-2.017-2-2H4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2 1 0 1 0 1 1v1c0 1-1 2-2 2s-1 .008-1 1.031V20c0 1 0 1 1 1z"/>
                        <path d="M15 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.757-2.017-2-2h-4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2h.75c0 2.25.25 4-2.75 4v3c0 1 0 1 1 1z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Our Mission</h2>
                    <p>"To be the silent guardian of your journey, ensuring that every soul we carry arrives not just at their destination, but in a state of absolute grace and peace."</p>
                    <div>
                        <a href="/services" class="cta-outline green">
                            Discover Our Ethos
                            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why-us">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: auto;" class="reveal">
                <span class="tagline" style="justify-content: center;">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2l3 6 6 3-6 3-3 6-3-6-6-3 6-3 3-6z"/></svg>
                    The Standards
                </span>
                <h2 class="section-title">The Radha Distinction</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bento-grid">
                <div class="bento-card bento-large reveal">
                    <h3>
                        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/></svg>
                        The Sacred Chauffeur
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-bottom: 0;">Our drivers are more than navigators. Handpicked for their integrity and trained in the etiquette of luxury, they understand the deep respect required for pilgrimage travel.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bento-card bento-small reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
                    <h3>
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2l3 6 6 3-6 3-3 6-3-6-6-3 6-3 3-6z"/></svg>
                        Pristine Cabs
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Every vehicle is deep-cleaned and maintained to showroom standards.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bento-card bento-small reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
                    <h3>
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                        Safety First
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-lead" style="margin-bottom: 0;">With 24/7 fleet monitoring and rigorous checks, your safety is our religion.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;" class="reveal">
                <a href="/standards" class="cta-outline">Compare Vehicle Classes
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guardian-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="guardian-grid">
                <div class="reveal">
                    <span class="tagline">
